  ],
  "solution_ref": "$a\\ne0,\\frac12,1$이면 방향 3번 전환. (i) $a=0$: $\\int_0^2-t^3(t-1)dt=-\\frac{12}5$. (ii) $a=\\frac12$: $-\\frac{11}{15}$. (iii) $a=1$: $\\int_0^2-t(t-1)^2(t-2)dt=\\frac4{15}$. 최댓값 $\\frac4{15}$",
